    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A wave of generator failures, including a critical failure threatening grid stability, exposed a severe power capacity loss in the Visayas grid zone in crisis. In response, the crisis authority restoring order declared a red alert and initiated a decisive intervention to prevent system collapse through load shedding, managing the escalating threat of disorderly power cuts.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Ruler",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
